also a big convention is in town tonight  and more are on the schedule but  is delta posing a risk to what's ahead  thank you for joining us at 11 i'm brian  loftis  and i'm denise valdez the magic trade  show is back for the first time in two  years  madison kimbrough spoke to convention  goers who admit  it is a little bit different this time  madison  yeah the magic fashion trade show is one  of the biggest attractions to take place  here at the las vegas convention center  and i spoke to several people that said  while it is different inside this year  it's great to have it back in action  we love coming here and there hasn't  been any for two years  this was the first one and we decided it  was worth getting on a plane  and coming and seeing connecting with  all of our vendors  and supporting the industry the magic is  back  at the las vegas convention center  monday the magic fashion trade show  known  as the most comprehensive fashion  marketplace in the u.s  arrived in vegas for a three-day stint  its first in two years  attendees say that the safety protocols  in place at the convention center  are on point making them feel  comfortable talking with groups of  people  and walking around in the crowd i felt  like everyone did a really good job  giving a little bit of distance everyone  had their face masks on  there were sanitation stations all  around  so i feel like all in all people just  like kind of respected  people's spaces and things like that  with the delta variant being a major  concern for travelers it leaves the  question of whether shows this fall will  get canceled  according to l-v-c-v-a there are no show  cancellations or postponements at this  time  rick diamond owner of a men's clothing  store in ohio  has been coming to the magic fashion  trade show since the 80s  and he says while he is pleased to see  it back in action things have changed  it's gone from here to the mandalay bay  and back and for  people like us it seemed to be a little  more active  back in the day just a little more  excitement  and now i feel a little more just about  business  now again the magic fashion trade show  will last until this wednesday august  11th and what's next on the books  we've got the international pizza expo  2021 that's going to be on august 17th  reporting live madison kimbrough 8 news  now
 

